---
ns: characters
---
{#
  characters.njk — 人物索引（P10 `docs/bloom-redesign-plan.md` §4.3）

  `.main-wrap` 内 4 段：页头（h1 两个 <span> 断行）→ `.work-filters`（**只有**行/格切换）
  → `.section-wrap.section-wrap-work.once-in`（**行式** + **卡片**两套列表）→ 页脚。

  ★ 两套列表**同时渲染**、由 JS 改类名切换（`work.njk` 注释的 ★ 条，照旧）：只渲染一套
  会让结构 diff 报"缺元素"。列表数据**从 `characters.json` 派生**（`src.11tydata.js` 的
  `indexList`），不另存一份（方案 §5 M4 步骤 2）。

  与原 `work.njk` 的两处差异：
    · **删掉 `.toggle-row`**（All / Design / Development 的筛选）—— 长廊与索引页都不带筛选
      （方案 D3 / §4.3）。`index-new.js` 里的筛选绑定代码**保留不删**（`DEVIATIONS.md` F3）。
    · 表头与行数据改为人物口径（`Character / Voice / …`）。

  行/格切换的列视图恢复依赖 `initCookieViews()` —— 它的选择器在 M4 由 `#work` 改为 `main`
  （`DEVIATIONS.md` **A3**），否则带 cookie `view=columns` 的访客进本页时列视图**静默不恢复**。
#}
<header class="section default-header work-header" data-scroll-section>
{% include "partials/nav-bar.njk" %}   <div class="container medium">
      <div class="row">
         <div class="flex-col once-in">
            <h1><span>Three people, </span><span>one story</span></h1>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</header>
<section class="section work-filters" data-scroll-section>
   <div class="container once-in">
      <div class="filter-row">
         <div class="grid-row">
            <div class="btn btn-normal btn-icon rows-btn active">
               <div class="btn-click magnetic" data-strength="25" data-strength-text="15">
                  <div class="btn-fill"></div>
                  <span class="btn-text">
                     <span class="btn-text-inner change"><svg style="width: 20px;" width="20" height="19" viewBox="0 0 20 19"><g fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"><path d="M0 6h20v1H0zM0 0h20v1H0zM0 12h20v1H0zM0 18h20v1H0z"></path></g></svg></span>
                  </span>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="btn btn-normal btn-icon columns-btn">
               <div class="btn-click magnetic" data-strength="25" data-strength-text="15">
                  <div class="btn-fill"></div>
                  <span class="btn-text">
                     <span class="btn-text-inner change"><svg style="width: 20px;" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><g fill="currentColor" fill-rule="nonzero"><path d="M8 0H0v8h8V0zM7 1v6H1V1h6zM8 12H0v8h8v-8zm-1 1v6H1v-6h6zM20 0h-8v8h8V0zm-1 1v6h-6V1h6zM20 12h-8v8h8v-8zm-1 1v6h-6v-6h6z"></path></g></svg></span>
                  </span>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
<section class="section-wrap section-wrap-work once-in" data-scroll-section>
   <section class="section work-grid small-work-grid grid-fade grid-rows-part visible">
      <div class="container">
         <div class="grid-sub-title">
{%- for h in indexList.headers %}
            <div class="flex-col">
               <h5>{{ h }}</h5>
            </div>
{%- endfor %}
         </div>
         <ul class="work-items mouse-pos-list-image-wrap all-active">
{%- for item in indexList.rows %}
                        <li class="visible">
               <div class="stripe animate"></div>
               <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
                  <div class="flex-col">
                     <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.col2 }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.col3 }}</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex-col animate">
                     <p>{{ item.col4 }}</p>
                  </div>
               </a>
            </li>
{%- endfor %}
                        <div class="stripe last animate"></div>
         </ul>
      </div>
   </section>
   <section class="section work-tiles grid-fade grid-columns-part">
      <div class="container">
         <ul>
{%- for item in indexList.rows %}
                        <li class="visible">
               <div class="single-tile-wrap">
                  <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="row">
                     <div class="flex-col">
                        <div class="tile-image">
                           <div class="overlay overlay-color" style="background-color: {{ item.tileColor }};"></div>
                           <div class="overlay overlay-image lazy" style="background-position: center center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;" data-bg="{{ item.tileImage }}"></div>                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex-col">
                        <h4><span>{{ item.name }}</span></h4>
                        <div class="stripe"></div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex-col">
                        <p>{{ item.col3 }}</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="flex-col">
                        <p>{{ item.col4 }}</p>
                     </div>
                  </a>
               </div>
            </li>
{%- endfor %}
                     </ul>
      </div>
   </section>
</section>
{% include "partials/footer-rounded.njk" %}
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
